B.bmQ=s(["Bleeding from bite site","Bleeding from old or partly old wounds","Systemic spontaneous bleeding (Gums, Nose, Malena, Hematuria, Vaginal bleeding, skin bleeds, mucosal bleeding)"],t.s)
